{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth","id":1141662,"title":"Chimerical governments on Earth?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-18T22:04:37-07:00","id":1141662,"title":"Chimerical governments on Earth?","content":"Just as the Fae have their own governments, is it possible for certain Chimera to secure their own lands on Earth, possibly with the aid of Hedge Magic and alliances with Mage and Fera factions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-19T08:30:17-07:00","id":1141761,"title":"","content":"I don't see why not. Particularly those centered on particularly aggressive dreams. Nightmare chimera can be very powerful. In-fact I could see all kinds of cults having chimera patrons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-19T16:09:31-07:00","id":1141927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MythAdvocate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth?p=1141761#post1141761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see why not. Particularly those centered on particularly aggressive dreams. Nightmare chimera can be very powerful. In-fact I could see all kinds of cults having chimera patrons.</div> </div> </div> </div>And redes that allow them to gain glamour through human sacrifice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-19T20:00:01-07:00","id":1142009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth#post1141662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just as the Fae have their own governments, is it possible for certain Chimera to secure their own lands on Earth, possibly with the aid of Hedge Magic and alliances with Mage and Fera factions?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think this would be very, very rare. Chimera and Glamour are not something that could be detected by your average mage or fera without explicit use of a Sphere or Gift. If you don't have that Sphere/Gift and haven't been Enchanted by a changeling, you can't see or interact with Chimera. Also, without enchantment or a couple of specific redes, the chimera can't communicate with or interact with the Autumn world. It would be very hard for them to set up any kind of territory or &quot;government&quot; that involved anything other than kithain. That could be possible with very powerful chimera.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://imgbb.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://image.ibb.co/fzeOgQ/1172c70f3ff188688852c74c8145285c_original_2_4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <br /> Visit my freehold for Changeling links, settings, art, and other goodies.<br /> <a href=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The Shepherd's Freehold</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13648-shepherd","name":"Shepherd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T05:04:16-07:00","id":1142104,"title":"","content":"If the Kenning Ability is possessed by psychics and Gramayre by occultists, that might be all that is needed to interact with chimera. But for this to work, it would need a powerful chimera involved.<br /> <br /> The Star Chamber sorcerers could easily fit this model. Other groups and individuals could include classic psychics with a spirit guide (actually a chimera), thralls of a dream lover/night hag, occultists tied to a primal dream of a mythic age, etc.<br /> <br /> In my home campaign, there are powerful Chimera that represent major concepts, forming a pantheon that is a potential patron or rival to Changeling governments. Entities such as Uncle Sam, Big Brother, Lady Liberty, Taxes, Lotto and the Red Menace are all dreaming powerhouses. That said they usually only interact with mortals in an abstract way, through concepts and dreams. A few have mortal adherents who know they serve something supernatural, but this is rare and reserved for zealots, magicians and such.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":1756,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","user":"MythAdvocate","date":". 09-20-2017, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-22T07:21:16-07:00","id":1142890,"title":"","content":"I would argue that the Kenning ability is NOT possessed by them. You must recall that C20 is meant to be comprehensive for Changeling. Like many games, it approximates other groups for crossover, but if you're going with crossover, most others would have Awareness, NOT Kenning. In the site I help to run, that's the ruling I've made, as it feels to me that they only extended Kenning to others because Awareness is not in the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-22T08:34:56-07:00","id":1142916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windthin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth?p=1142890#post1142890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would argue that the Kenning ability is NOT possessed by them. You must recall that C20 is meant to be comprehensive for Changeling. Like many games, it approximates other groups for crossover, but if you're going with crossover, most others would have Awareness, NOT Kenning. In the site I help to run, that's the ruling I've made, as it feels to me that they only extended Kenning to others because Awareness is not in the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>For &quot;the others&quot; I'd rule so, that Kenning is specialty of Awareness and Gremayre is specialty of Occult, but in a setting, where everything supernatural is derived from the Dreaming: psychics, hedge magics and even whatever Prodigals ST would want to add, I'd say they might as well use the Changeling skills.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":5211,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","user":"Firkraag","date":". 09-26-2017, 10:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-22T10:50:20-07:00","id":1142972,"title":"","content":"Kenning and Awareness are two different beasts entirely when it comes to crossover. Awareness is that gut sense (that used to be pretty much Mage only with a few exceptions) of something being &quot;off&quot; in an area or drawing your &quot;supernatural&quot; senses towards a supernatural disturbance, literally a &quot;magical&quot; companion to Alertness. Kenning is a Chimerical mixture of Awareness and Alertness (or was, will be getting C20 soon) focused on creatures and effects of the Dreaming for spotting things lurking in Chimerical Reality or the Fae Mein of Changelings who have suffered chimerical deaths. <br /> <br /> Chimera having a governing influence in the Autumn World would be very rare and more than a little unusual. Chimera having an Influence on the Autumn world absolutely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T18:58:29-07:00","id":1143379,"title":"","content":"I agree with the others who have said that Kenning is NOT Awareness. Personally, I believe that Kenning can only be possessed by someone with fae blood (kithain, gallain, kinain, etc.). It is a supernatural perception of things of the Dreaming. How would you have ANY connection to the Dreaming if you don't have any fae blood? Remember that this is categorized as a Talent, while Greymare is a Knowledge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://imgbb.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://image.ibb.co/fzeOgQ/1172c70f3ff188688852c74c8145285c_original_2_4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <br /> Visit my freehold for Changeling links, settings, art, and other goodies.<br /> <a href=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The Shepherd's Freehold</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13648-shepherd","name":"Shepherd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T19:16:02-07:00","id":1143384,"title":"","content":"Eh, I'd let anybody with extensive interaction with the fae, enchanted or not, pick up a maximum of 1 dot in Kenning. It'd represent a deeper understanding of what to look for, even if it can't be seen or perceived directly.<br /> <br /> To get higher than 1 dot, though, I'd require being more-or-less permanently enchanted!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T22:00:55-07:00","id":1143395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth?p=1143379#post1143379\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree with the others who have said that Kenning is NOT Awareness. Personally, I believe that Kenning can only be possessed by someone with fae blood (kithain, gallain, kinain, etc.). It is a supernatural perception of things of the Dreaming. How would you have ANY connection to the Dreaming if you don't have any fae blood? Remember that this is categorized as a Talent, while Greymare is a Knowledge.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Hollow Ones probably can manage it due to their apparent relationship to the Dreaming and the Mists. I also like the idea of a wizard mentor who has a sixth and seventh sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T01:52:42-07:00","id":1143421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demigod Beast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth?p=1143384#post1143384\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh, I'd let anybody with extensive interaction with the fae, enchanted or not, pick up a maximum of 1 dot in Kenning. It'd represent a deeper understanding of what to look for, even if it can't be seen or perceived directly.<br /> <br /> To get higher than 1 dot, though, I'd require being more-or-less permanently enchanted!</div> </div> </div> </div>You could easily justify this as coming from a trace amount of 'fae blood' in the user. After all with all the fae souls trapped within human bodies there must be some who do not wake up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11490-dogstar","name":"Dogstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11490_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T07:14:30-07:00","id":1143446,"title":"","content":"True...I'd not thought of that...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T10:04:58-07:00","id":1143501,"title":"","content":"But why should kenning be possessed by only the Fae? Haven't young children always been capable of using the kenning ability? The ability to sense and belong to the Dreaming has always been within the reach of anyone who has a low Banality. Has that changed in C20?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T19:58:06-07:00","id":1143645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth?p=1143501#post1143501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But why should kenning be possessed by only the Fae? Haven't young children always been capable of using the kenning ability? The ability to sense and belong to the Dreaming has always been within the reach of anyone who has a low Banality. Has that changed in C20?</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a difference between perceiving things of the Dreaming and having the Kenning Talent. Heck, not even all full kithain have to have Kenning! Just like not all Mages will have dots in Awareness. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://imgbb.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://image.ibb.co/fzeOgQ/1172c70f3ff188688852c74c8145285c_original_2_4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <br /> Visit my freehold for Changeling links, settings, art, and other goodies.<br /> <a href=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The Shepherd's Freehold</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13648-shepherd","name":"Shepherd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-24T21:06:43-07:00","id":1143659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth?p=1143645#post1143645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There is a difference between perceiving things of the Dreaming and having the Kenning Talent. Heck, not even all full kithain have to have Kenning! Just like not all Mages will have dots in Awareness. </div> </div> </div> </div>Nevertheless, completely ordinary children can have Kenning, unless something has changed. This is something of the soul, and human souls are deeply tied to the Dreaming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T14:02:33-07:00","id":1143891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth?p=1143659#post1143659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nevertheless, completely ordinary children can have Kenning, unless something has changed. This is something of the soul, and human souls are deeply tied to the Dreaming.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Do you have a book reference for this? I know that children can typically perceive things of the Dreaming because they have a low Banality rating, but that doesn't mean they have the Kenning Talent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://imgbb.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://image.ibb.co/fzeOgQ/1172c70f3ff188688852c74c8145285c_original_2_4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <br /> Visit my freehold for Changeling links, settings, art, and other goodies.<br /> <a href=\"https://theshepherdsfreehold.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The Shepherd's Freehold</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13648-shepherd","name":"Shepherd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T07:01:00-07:00","id":1144046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firkraag</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1141662-chimerical-governments-on-earth?p=1142916#post1142916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For &quot;the others&quot; I'd rule so, that Kenning is specialty of Awareness and Gremayre is specialty of Occult, but in a setting, where everything supernatural is derived from the Dreaming: psychics, hedge magics and even however Prodigals ST would want to add, I'd say they might as well use the Changeling skills.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is my view of using those skills. Especially when dealing with enchanted mortals and special/allied dreamers. If using Prodigals and crossovers, their own rules are fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span styl